cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pypedigree in your research, please cite it as below."
title: pypedigree
abstract: >-
  Generate publication-quality pedigree (family tree) diagrams from standard
  pedigree files used in genetics research. Supports multi-phenotype colour
  bands, polygenic score distributions, twins, consanguinity, carrier
  notation, interactive SVG output and PLINK interoperability.
type: software
authors:
